  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Support to the Preparation for Community based Rural Development Planning and Implementation of a Pilot Project in the Livno area (Canton 10)</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="2">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">There will be two components of the project, one at national, state level and one at local government level (i.e. Canton 10) with the following outputs:
Output 1: Capacity in community based rural development planning of entity and state level Ministry staff enhanced
Output 2: Pilot project on community based rural development planning in Livno area implemented</narrative>
  </description>
